,"Conditions":"Sub Limit :\n\nProperty in Transit within the Republic of Indonesia for the amount up to USD 1,000,000.00 any one occurrence (Inland Transit Clause - Wording as attached).\n\nProperty in the course of Construction or Erection (Limit USD 1,000,000.00 any one occurrence – excluding Testing & Commissioning).\n\nCuriosity or work of art within enclosed premises for the value of not exceeding USD 200,000.00 per occurrence.\n\nMoveable Property Limit IDR 100,000,000.00 per occurrence and IDR 1,000,000,000.00 in aggregate (As Per Munich Re Standard Wording)\n\nSub limit Money Insurance\nCash in Safe    : USD 1,000,000.00 anyone Location\nCash in Transit : USD 1,000,000.00 anyone Shipment\n\nElectronic Equipment Subject to Munich Re Wording with loss limit up to  USD 500,000.00 any one occurence\n\nLOCATION DEFINITION \n\nFor the purposes of the application of earthquake, volcanic eruption, tsunami and fire following earthquake, volcanic eruption, tsunami deductible of this policy, Location is defined as any building, storage area, tank, dock, wharf, pier, bulkhead (or groups thereof bounded on all sides by public streets, private streets, private roads or open waterways or open land space, each of which shall be not less than 50 (fifty) feet wide, (for the purposes of this definition, any bridge or tunnel crossing such street or waterway or open space shall render such separation inoperative unless equipped with fire wall and/or doors or other approved methods whereby the buildings etc on either side are currently designated as separate fire areas by qualified fire surveyors. Each separate designated fire area is deemed to be a separate location for the purposes of this insurance.\n\nShould more than one deductibles appear under this Policy for any claim or series or claim arising out from each event, such deductibles shall not be aggregated, the highest single event of deductible only shall apply."
